WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:16.280
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.790
Koharu-chan, can you keep up?

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:23.290
Yeah! I'm doing fine thanks to my training on Venus Ark.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.710
But of course!

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.590
All right, let's go for another lap around campus!

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.460
Isn't that...

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.470
Mahiru-chan!

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.930
Yume.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.310
Good afternoon, Asahi-senpai.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:42.810
Koharu-chan, it's been forever! How've you been?

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.020
Great!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.560
Mahiru-chan, are you going somewhere?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:50.820
Not anywhere special. I was just about to head home with Nii-san.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.320
Home?

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.200
For any particular reason?

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.950
Our parents are both returning for the first time in a while.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:02.160
I think I remember you saying your parents were always really busy.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.080
Yeah.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:07.710
My mom spends a lot of her time overseas doing modeling work,

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:12.590
and my dad rarely comes home due to his business.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:19.800
We have no idea when a chance like this will come again, so we took the opportunity to take tomorrow off.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:21.600
That sounds nice.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.770
Well, I don't want to keep the driver waiting, so we should be going.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.190
Oh, sure.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:29.940
See you.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.320
Take care.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.820
Mahiru-chan's home...

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.990
I've just gotta see it!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:41.650
Right, I'm not in my dorm...

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.120
Come in.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.240
Have you awakened, Princess?

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:52.750
Oh!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.500
Good morning, sleepy princess. {in contrast because not name}

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.500
Onee-chan! You don't have work?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.180
I was able to adjust my schedule and free up time today.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.760
We hardly ever get to have the family all together.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.930
I see. I'm glad.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.020
Now then, may I have your attention?

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.560
Can I interest you in Chef Asahi's special chocolate muffins?

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.810
Did you make these yourself?{yeah yeah but}

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.900
Wow, they look scrumptious!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.690
I'll try one.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:21.030
Me too.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.070
Delicious!

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:29.160
It tastes just like the ones from France.{longness}

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:33.540
Yes! I finally managed to steal that bakery's recipe!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:39.460
Oh? Should the great detective Pinky Cat of all people really be resorting to thievery?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.880
With this, I have the confidence to make it through my show.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.510
Which show?

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:52.270
We're planning to add a segment called Chef Asahi's Cooking Show to M4's weekly TV program.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:55.060
Think of this as a rehearsal.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:58.940
Besides, I wanted Mom and Dad to try them too.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.320
I get it.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.530
I'm sure they'll be overjoyed.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.530
Thanks for helping me, girls.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.700
Thank you too! They tasted wonderful.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:15.710
You know what? We should go out somewhere until our parents get here.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.590
That sounds good! Mahiru, is there any place you want to go?

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:24.800
The zoo!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.510
What's so funny?!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.930
Sorry, sorry! I just remembered what happened the last time.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.520
The last time?

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:39.520
Back when you were little and we visited the zoo.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:42.820
When you saw the hedgehog at the petting zoo...

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:46.320
You started crying and screaming, "It's scary! I'll get poked!" {I figured 'stabbed' is too strong}

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.740
Then you ran away and caused a huge scene.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:55.500
That didn't—well, maybe it did...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.670
Okay, it's decided. We'll go to the zoo.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:02.210
We've gotta make sure you've gotten over your hedgehog-phobia.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.260
Geez, Nii-san!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.680
Oh? Pardon me a moment.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.680
Hello, what is it?

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.430
It's from a movie guy.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:18.640
No, really? Got it, I'll be right over.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.350
Man, right now?

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.560
Did something happen?

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:26.190
Tsubasa says something came up and they need me for an interview.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:33.200
I need to go in and film a few extra cuts for the movie I thought we finished.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:38.370
I'll be fine! You can't just refuse a job.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.830
Go on, you shouldn't dilly-dally.

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:47.300
We'll be back as soon as we can.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.760
We can go to the zoo next time.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.640
I told you not to worry about it.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.010
Go, they're waiting for you.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.060
Okay, we'll be off.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.270
See you after.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.930
Take care!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.150
Now then, guess I'll do some cleaning.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:17.910
Just a touch more...

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.410
Okay, great!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.540
Yep, it's perfect!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:29.420
Huh?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.550
Everyone?

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.550
It's so big!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.560
Sorry for dropping in on you.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.020
Huh? Are you alone?

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.190
It's just me right now.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.270
What a splendid view.

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:48.650
Ako-chan, look up! There's a helicopter!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.320
There's a heliport on the roof.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.820
That explains it.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:55.410
Anyway, why are you here?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.200
Oh, um...

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:01.080
You see, we're free until this evening, so...

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:05.540
Just be honest and say you were interested in seeing Mahiru's home.{actually, how did they get the address}{sutookaa, otherwise the moroboshi}

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.210
What?

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:11.260
I opposed it because I didn't want to be a bother.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:14.470
Sorry, are we bothering you?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:21.230
Not at all. I was a bit surprised, 
but it's fine. Thanks for coming.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.770
Mahiru-chan!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:27.610
O-Of course! The more the merrier, as they say!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.610
With that said...

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:33.610
It's time to revive Ako-chan's Expedition!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.370
This is my family's shared closet room.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.910
There are so many clothes...

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.130
It's bigger than my room!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.880
Want to try some on?

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.050
Can we? Yay!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.190
This is my room.

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.150
Adorable!

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.910
This room just shouts "you". {"Mahiru"?}{beide sind ok}

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.570
Y-You think?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.790
Look how cute you were as a child!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.420
Let me see.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.920
Wow, she really was adorable!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:34.220
Mahiru-chan, Yozora-senpai, and... who's this?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.930
Ah, well...

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.340
Asahi-niisan.

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:38.640
Huh?!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:42.430
Onee-chan dressed him up in my clothes for fun.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.890
Would you like more tea?

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.310
I'm good, thanks.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.690
How about more cookies?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.440
Oh, Nii-san made some muffins too.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.860
Mahiru, you're acting like a mother.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.450
R-Really?

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.200
After seeing everything, this really is a lovely apartment.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:05.540
We moved in two years ago, but I've lived in 
Four Star's dorms for most of that time.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.710
It doesn't really feel like home to me.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.080
I see.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.040
Plus, it's just awful to clean.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.000
Are you <i>sure</i> you're not a mother?

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.390
It's already this late!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.060
We should get going.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:23.850
Yeah.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.100
Mahiru-chan, thanks so much for today.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.560
We can hang out at my place next time.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:34.360
And don't forget to watch the live broadcast of my special event tonight.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.110
Thank you again for the tea and snacks.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.990
I'm glad you enjoyed it. Good luck with your work, everyone.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.280
See you.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.540
Bye-bye.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.710
You'll be going with Yume, right Koharu?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.250
Yeah.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.460
What about you?

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.840
Hanazono Kirara will be joining me as a special guest.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.300
What's wrong, Rola?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.760
I can't find my Aikatsu Mobile.

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:58.760
Sounds exciting.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.550
Huh?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:02.300
Sorry, you go on ahead. I'll go find it.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.010
Okay, got it.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.610
<i>I've been left alone yet again.</i>

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.700
Sorry, but have you seen my Aikatsu Mobile...

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.120
What's wrong?

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.350
Geez, it's not <i>that</i> funny.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:52.850
Sorry, okay? I just wasn't expecting to find Kasumi Mahiru feeling lonely.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:54.100
Give me a break...

00:11:54.100 --> 00:12:00.280
Mom and Dad are always busy with work, 
and all Nii-san does is play with his friends.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:04.110
When it was just Onee-chan and me we colored together...

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:08.040
But then she went off ahead to Four Star alone!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.710
You know, I think I understand that feeling.

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:16.840
My parents were often out of the house on their concert tours.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.630
They were?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:23.680
I'd forgotten about it since I moved into 
Four Star and spend every day with you all,

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:26.890
but it really was lonely watching the house alone.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:31.890
Anyway, just try and enjoy what's left of your quiet day off.{are you normally a "try and"?}

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:36.150
Come tomorrow, we won't leave you alone, like it or not.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.650
Rola...

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.610
Hey, are you okay on time?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.410
I forgot!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.160
Be sure to have fun with your whole family, Mama Mahiru!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.830
Yes, I will. Be on your way.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.710
<i>I wonder if Mom and Dad will be here soon.</i>

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.090
Yume?

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:05.220
Hello, Mahiru-chan?

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.090
What's up?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:10.180
Ako-chan just called me, and she's kind of in trouble.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.270
What kind of trouble?

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:14.810
Kirara-chan was supposed to appear at her event today,

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.020
but she's stuck in traffic and might not be able to make it in time.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:21.190
What?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.450
We have our own show right now, so we can't do anything.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:30.160
Please, Mahiru-chan! I know you're supposed to be off, 
but Ako-chan must be freaking out by herself.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.200
You're the only person we can turn to. {rip theater class admins}{should've appointed better ones}

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:38.130
But even if I left now, there's no guarantee I'll make it...

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.880
Hello, Mahiru-chan?

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.550
Okay, I'll do something about it.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:06.860
When are you going to get here, Hanazono Kirara?!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.110
Hello?!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:11.080
Ako! Why didn't you contact me?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:12.830
Mahiru?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.000
Because today, you're...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.330
Yume told me the situation.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.750
I'll be there within half an hour, 
so get the event started for now.

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.840
Wait, how do you even plan to...

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:27.050
Don't worry, I have an idea.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.880
I'll see you soon.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.600
Saotome-san, please go on standby.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.310
O-Okay!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.940
It's good to be home.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.820
Yes, I wonder how many months it's been.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.570
Mom, Dad!

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.410
Oh, Mahiru! Have you been well?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:54.120
What are you doing with that large bag?

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.290
Let me borrow your helicopter!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:05.300
Everyone, how did you enjoy my performance?

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:11.800
We have even more stages lined up for you to enjoy tonight!{for the record, I sort of disapprove of using stage like this, but}

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:13.970
<i>I'm buying as much time as possible with talk, 
but I can't delay much longer!</i>

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.760
Look forward to them!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.020
<i>What's...</i>

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.810
<i>D-Don't tell me!</i>

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:22.270
<i>Mahiru?</i>

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.410
Huh, what's that?

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:40.370
K-Kiddies, my good friend Kasumi Mahiru-chan has just come running—

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.960
No, come flying to the show!

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.920
Good evening, everyone!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:55.510
I'm Kasumi Mahiru, and I just came floating down from the sky!

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:01.270
It looked like you were having lots of fun, and I wanted to join in!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:07.110
Is it okay if I sing a song for you before Hanazono Kirara-chan has her turn?

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.900
Mahiru...

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:18.540
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.550
Blossom in glory, my dress!{I kinda want to make this a command ("blossom, my dress") or something like that | also, are you sure about having sakihokoru as "bloom with pride"? I think it might work but it feels kinda dictionary-ish since sakihokoru is usually just saku but stronger}

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:36.230
Just because you barely managed to get here in time does not excuse how much you worried me!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.900
I'm sorry...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:41.360
How many times have I told you to always leave margin for error?

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:46.490
Calm down. Kirara looks sorry for what she did, so why not forgive her?

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:47.660
Right?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.790
I'm sorry!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.420
I'll never be late again!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.710
There, there. Let's be more careful next time.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.220
Honestly...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.680
Excuse me.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.890
It's time for the internet photoshoot stream.{I'm pretty sure photoshoot as one word is long-set mezashite policy}{I thought it was the opposite}

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.680
Ah, okay! We're coming!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.270
I should be leaving now.

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:13.440
What? Stay and do it with us, Mahiru-chan.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:19.440
No, this was supposed to be your event, and I really need to get home.

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.740
But...

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.450
I understand.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.200
You truly saved me today.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.950
The next time you need help, I'll run straight to your side!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.290
Thanks!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:38.670
<i>I ended up being out really late.</i>

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.430
I'm home...

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.800
Happy birthday, Mahiru!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.430
What are you all doing?

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.100
Welcome home, Mahiru.

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.060
Happy birthday.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:59.270
But my birthday's not until next month.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:02.110
Take a close look at my special cake.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:07.070
"Happy 1 Month Early Birthday"...{ランチちゃん...}

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:12.910
It was Nee-san's idea. She figured we might not all be able to get together on the 28th next month.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:16.170
It's a bit early, but let's celebrate!

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:19.380
I get it, but it's still way too early!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:20.710
Now then...

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.720
This is our present to you!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.840
Thank you!

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:33.230
It's a hedgehog plush!

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.680
How cute!

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:37.060
It reminds me of back then.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:39.480
She was terrified of it.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.650
Geez, just forget about it already!

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:50.330
We're all been so busy there haven't been many chances to be together as a family.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.330
We're sorry we can't be with you more.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.000
Have you been lonely?

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:59.540
No, I'm okay.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:02.550
I have Onee-chan, Nii-san, and my friends.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:12.810
I know! Why don't we plan to go out 
somewhere the next time we're all free?

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:16.940
Good idea. Kids, is there anywhere you'd like to go?

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:21.690
The zoo!

00:23:55.990 --> 00:24:02.870
It was fantastic seeing you float down from the sky and watching your brilliant performance with your Star Wings!

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:05.670
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light!

00:24:05.670 --> 00:24:10.010
No matter when and where, 
I'll gloriously bloom in this dress!

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:12.340
Hey, I just saw a mysterious girl.

00:24:12.340 --> 00:24:13.550
In your imagination?

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:16.680
No! Flowers bloomed when she sang.

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:17.760
That's preposterous!

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:19.810
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:22.100
Fairy idol, Futaba Aria.

00:24:22.100 --> 00:24:24.270
Become the first-star idol!
